IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0015.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 WS-CHN             PIC X.
    05 WS-CPF             PIC X.
    05 WS-TXAMT           PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-HLD             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 FR-FLG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM ONLINE-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "WS-HLD=" WS-HLD
    DISPLAY "FR-FLG=" FR-FLG
    STOP RUN.
ONLINE-SCREEN.
    IF WS-CHN = 'O'
        IF WS-CPF = 'N' AND WS-TXAMT > 2250
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-HLD
            MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
        ELSE
            IF WS-TXAMT > 17500
                MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
